        private static readonly Lazy<IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, ManifestFile>> LocalManifests = new(RheometryProvenance.Enrich(BuildManifests(typeof(RheometerOutputData), RheoSenseConstants.ActivePitManifest, RheoSenseConstants.Provider, "DWISBridge"), true));

        private readonly Lazy<IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, ManifestFile>> composedManifests;
        private readonly Lazy<IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, Dictionary<string, QuerySpecification>>> composedQueries;
        public RheometerOutputData(RheometerSource source, IEnumerable<string>? excludedProperties = null)
        {
            source.Validate();
            var installation = new RheometerSource { Id = source.Id, Placement = source.Placement, BlackboardNodeNamespace = source.BlackboardNodeNamespace, RigId = source.RigId, PhysicalLocationId = source.PhysicalLocationId };
            var excluded = excludedProperties?.ToHashSet(StringComparer.Ordinal) ?? new HashSet<string>(StringComparer.Ordinal);
            composedManifests = new(() => PlacementSemantics.Compose(LocalManifests.Value, installation)
                .Where(pair => !excluded.Contains(pair.Key.Name)).ToDictionary(pair => pair.Key, pair => pair.Value));
            composedQueries = new(() => PlacementSemantics.Queries(composedManifests.Value, installation.BlackboardNodeNamespace));
        }
        public ManifestFile CreatePhysicalLocationManifest() => PlacementSemantics.PhysicalLocationManifest(Manifests.Value.Values.First());
        public virtual IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, Dictionary<string, QuerySpecification>> CreateQueries(string nodeNamespace) => PlacementSemantics.Queries(Manifests.Value, nodeNamespace);
        public override Lazy<IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, ManifestFile>> Manifests => composedManifests;
        public override Lazy<IReadOnlyDictionary<PropertyInfo, Dictionary<string, QuerySpecification>>> SparQLQueries => composedQueries;

